      "content": "but i dont have insurance and going to the doctor is gonna cost me like hundreds of dollars. it doesnt even look that bad, just a little red. if i just wipe the needle with alcohol really well and do a tiny tiny poke, is there really that much of a risk?? i just need the pressure to go down so i can sleep.",
