    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i hear you but i really cant afford a clinic right now. if i cant drain it, what else can i do at home to make it better? are there any specific ointments or even just warm compresses that would help it drain on its own so i dont have to deal with this? i just want to manage the pain and get it to pop naturally.",
